{"version": 2, "width": 120, "height": 80, "timestamp": 1778684459, "idle_time_limit": 3.0, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": "xterm-color"}, "title": "Ubuntu AI Packaging Mentor — Persona Contrast: Beginner · MOTU · CoreDev"}
[0.088859, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;36m\u001b[1m  Ubuntu AI Packaging Mentor — Persona Contrast Demo\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;36m  Beginner · MOTU · CoreDev — same tools, different depth\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;36m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[2.08902, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;36m\u001b[1m  SESSION 1 of 3 — Beginner Persona → Audit Skill\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;36m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[4.089254, "o", "\u001b[1;33mWatch how the mentor explains concepts in plain language.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[5.901182, "o", "\u001b[1m\r\r\n╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\r\r\n║      Ubuntu AI Packaging Mentor  (CoreDev Edition)   ║\r\r\n╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\r\r\n\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1mSelect your experience level:\u001b[0m\r\r\n  \u001b[36m1\u001b[0m) Beginner\u001b[33m  — Explains the 'Why' — packaging concepts in plain language.\u001b[0m\r\r\n  \u001b[36m2\u001b[0m) MOTU\u001b[33m  — Focuses on Ubuntu Policy and compliance.\u001b[0m\r\r\n  \u001b[36m3\u001b[0m) CoreDev\u001b[33m  — Raw output — logs, diffs, system state. No preamble.\u001b[0m\r\r\n  \u001b[36mq\u001b[0m) Quit\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1mEnter choice [1-3]:\u001b[0m "]
[7.32338, "o", "\u001b[32m\r\r\n✓ Persona set to: Beginner — Explains the 'Why' — packaging concepts in plain language.\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1mEnter path to package source directory:\u001b[0m "]
[11.395036, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[1mSelect a skill:\u001b[0m\r\r\n  \u001b[36m1\u001b[0m) Audit\u001b[33m  — Legal/copyright analysis — produces a DEP-5 debian/copyright file.\u001b[0m\r\r\n  \u001b[36m2\u001b[0m) Detect\u001b[33m  — Dependency discovery — resolves #include headers to Build-Depends packages.\u001b[0m\r\r\n  \u001b[36m3\u001b[0m) Scribe\u001b[33m  — Changelog generation — summarises git log into debian/changelog format.\u001b[0m\r\r\n  \u001b[36m4\u001b[0m) Patch\u001b[33m  — Source patching — manages quilt patch series on upstream source.\u001b[0m\r\r\n  \u001b[36mq\u001b[0m) Quit\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1mEnter choice [1-4]:\u001b[0m "]
[13.016841, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[36m▶\u001b[0m \u001b[1mAudit\u001b[0m on \u001b[33mlab/sources/hello-package\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r  ⠋ Audit: context … (usually ~120s)   \r  ⠙ Audit: context … (usually ~120s)   \r  ⠹ Audit: context … (usually ~120s)   \r  ⠸ Audit: context … (usually ~120s)   \r  ⠼ Audit: context … (usually ~120s)   "]
[13.057975, "o", "\r  ⠴ Audit: context … (usually ~120s)   "]
[13.158056, "o", "\r  ⠦ Audit: context … (usually ~120s)   "]
[13.258054, "o", "\r  ⠧ Audit: context … (usually ~120s)   "]
[13.358253, "o", "\r  ⠇ Audit: context … (usually ~120s)   "]
[13.458628, "o", "\r  ⠏ Audit: context … (usually ~120s)   "]
[13.558698, "o", "\r                                                                      \r"]
[13.559009, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[32m[Beginner]\u001b[0m The Audit skill scans every source file for its license and copyright holder, then produces a DEP-5 debian/copyright file — the machine-readable format Ubuntu's archive requires. Without it your package cannot be uploaded. Think of it as the legal receipt for all the code you're shipping.\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[36m\r\r\nCalling Agent...\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[13.559189, "o", "\r  ⠋ Audit: before save … (usually ~120s)   "]
[13.659639, "o", "\r  ⠙ Audit: before save … (usually ~120s)   "]
[13.759941, "o", "\r  ⠹ Audit: before save … (usually ~120s)   "]
[13.860415, "o", "\r  ⠸ Audit: before save … (usually ~120s)   "]
[13.960619, "o", "\r  ⠼ Audit: before save … (usually ~120s)   "]
[14.060939, "o", "\r  ⠴ Audit: before save … (usually ~120s)   "]
[14.160947, "o", "\r  ⠦ Audit: before save … (usually ~120s)   "]
[14.261467, "o", "\r  ⠧ Audit: before save … (usually ~120s)   "]
[14.36188, "o", "\r  ⠇ Audit: before save … (usually ~120s)   "]
[14.462098, "o", "\r  ⠏ Audit: before save … (usually ~120s)   "]
[14.562362, "o", "\r                                                                      \r"]
[14.562676, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[32m[Beginner]\u001b[0m Before saving: verify all copyright holders appear under their Files: stanza, License: identifiers are valid SPDX names (e.g. GPL-2.0-only), and any third-party vendored code has its own stanza.\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1mWrite debian/copyright to target directory? [y/N]:\u001b[0m "]
