[39.921681, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[32m[Beginner]\u001b[0m Review for UNKNOWN license identifiers — those need manual research. Next: run 'lintian' to catch remaining issues, then move on to Detect to fill in your Build-Depends.\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1mRun another skill? [Y/n]:\u001b[0m "]
